  "summary": "Install-time exfiltration of host/user/cwd to hardcoded bare-IP endpoint",
  "details": "The package's preinstall lifecycle script runs automatically on `npm install` and sends the installer's hostname, OS username, and current working directory to a hardcoded remote host at http://209.126.81.147 over plain HTTP, embedding the values as URL path segments under `/etoro-depconf-poce346552f776f/npm/`. The destination is a bare IP address, not configurable, and unrelated to any legitimate publisher infrastructure. The `999.0.0` version and eToro-themed name are consistent with a dependency-confusion lure targeting an internal package name.",
